---
import SectionHeading from "../shared/SectionHeading.astro";
import { deliverList } from "../../data/home";
---

<section class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-stone-50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="What We Build"
      headline="A growth system — not a stack of separate services."
      subhead="Strategy, experience, messaging, marketing, and measurement, working as one connected system instead of disconnected pieces."
    />
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600">
      Depending on what your business actually needs, that can include your
      marketing strategy, your website or customer experience, your brand and
      messaging, your campaigns, and the systems and data that measure how it's
      all performing. None of those pieces work in isolation. A great website
      doesn't help if the marketing that drives people to it doesn't match what
      they find there. A campaign doesn't help if there's no way to measure what
      it produced. EverJourneys builds and connects the specific pieces your
      growth system needs — around your situation, not a fixed list.
    </p>
    <!-- Kept visually secondary on purpose: this is not a service menu. -->
    <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-400">
      {deliverList.join(" · ")}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
